                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c669f269-6e83-4ef4-bdc3-9425512b4d2f" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c669f269-6e83-4ef4-bdc3-9425512b4d2f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_6 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mkdir: cannot create directory '/mnt/lustre/mdsrate': File exists
test_6 failed with 1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This looks like it is happening on master regularly, and is likely a test script issue?&lt;/p&gt;





